WEBVTT

00:00:55.789 --> 00:01:00.216
But children like ours
are not preordained as a gift.

00:01:01.145 --> 00:01:02.296
They're a gift

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:05.045
because that's what we have chosen."

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:10.280
We make those choices all our lives.

00:01:11.351 --> 00:01:13.395
When I was in second grade,

00:01:13.419 --> 00:01:16.276
Bobby Finkel had a birthday party

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.573
and invited everyone in our class but me.

00:01:20.637 --> 00:01:23.131
My mother assumed
there had been some sort of error,

00:01:23.155 --> 00:01:24.793
and she called Mrs. Finkel,

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:29.428
who said that Bobby didn't like me
and didn't want me at his party.